    {
      "start": 494.32,
      "duration": 0.76,
      "text": "You did it"
    },
    {
      "start": 495.08,
      "duration": 1.36,
      "text": "Finally"
    },
    {
      "start": 496.44,
      "duration": 1.52,
      "text": "How do you feel"
    },
    {
      "start": 497.96,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "text": "Really, really happy"
    },
    {
      "start": 499.4,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "and proud of myself"
    },
    {
      "start": 503.4,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "text": "It’s all because I had a great coach"
    },
    {
      "start": 504.4,
      "duration": 0.84,
      "text": "Thank you, coach"
    },
    {
      "start": 505.24,
      "duration": 1.24,
      "text": "I had a great student"
    },
    {
      "start": 507.24,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "text": "I’ve been teaching here for nearly seven years"
    },
    {
      "start": 510.8,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "One thing that you have that some archers don’t"
    },
    {
      "start": 514.8,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "text": "is a positive mindset"
    },
    {
      "start": 517.32,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "text": "When you get a bad shot and score only 6 points"
    },
    {
      "start": 519.92,
      "duration": 1.72,
      "text": "you shrug it off and try again"
    },
    {
      "start": 521.64,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "text": "You never gave up"
    },
    {
      "start": 523.48,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": "I think that’s a great attitude"
    },
    {
      "start": 525.88,
      "duration": 1.96,
      "text": "At my age"
    },
    {
      "start": 527.84,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "text": "learning a new skill really gives me"
    },
    {
      "start": 533.52,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "a great sense of achievement"
    },
    {
      "start": 536.44,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "If I have the chance to learn a new sport"
    },
    {
      "start": 540.2,
      "duration": 1.52,
      "text": "or something interesting"
    },
    {
      "start": 541.72,
      "duration": 0.68,
      "text": "I will"
    },
    {
      "start": 542.4,
      "duration": 2.08,
      "text": "Like flower arrangement"
    },
    {
      "start": 544.48,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "text": "or carving"
    },
    {
      "start": 546.24,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "I’ll continue to explore new activities"
    },
    {
      "start": 550.24,
      "duration": 1.88,
      "text": "Like ballroom dancing"
    },
    {
      "start": 553.68,
      "duration": 1.72,
      "text": "Will you continue with archery"
    },
    {
      "start": 555.4,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "text": "I will"
    },
    {
      "start": 556.0,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "text": "See you at West Coast"
    },
    {
      "start": 557.76,
      "duration": 0.8,
      "text": "I’ll be waiting"
    },
    {
      "start": 558.56,
      "duration": 0.8,
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "start": 559.36,
      "duration": 1.08,
      "text": "Let’s go to the Olympics together"
    },
    {
      "start": 562.04,
      "duration": 2.12,
      "text": "I’ll be there to cheer for Kai Ning"
    },
    {
      "start": 565.64,
      "duration": 1.24,
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "start": 568.04,
      "duration": 1.48,
      "text": "7 Days, I Can Do It"
    },
    {
      "start": 569.52,
      "duration": 2.2,
      "text": "We did it"
    },
    {
      "start": 586.84,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "text": "Eric, your results today"
    },
    {
      "start": 590.52,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "text": "You can keep it as a souvenir "
    },
    {
      "start": 592.96,
      "duration": 0.76,
      "text": "Thank you"
    },
    {
      "start": 593.72,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "text": "Remember us when you look at it"
    },
    {
      "start": 596.32,
      "duration": 0.48,
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "start": 596.8,
      "duration": 0.44,
      "text": "Don’t forget us"
    },
    {
      "start": 597.24,
      "duration": 1.04,
      "text": "I’ll remember you"
    },
    {
      "start": 598.28,
      "duration": 0.64,
      "text": "for sure"
    },
    {
      "start": 601.4,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "text": "7 Days, I Can Do It"
    },
    {
      "start": 603.24,
      "duration": 0.96,
      "text": "We did it"
    },
    {
      "start": 605.56,
      "duration": 0.52,
      "text": "Thank you"
    },
    {
      "start": 606.08,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "text": "Thank you so much"
    }
  ]
}